==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*þuljaną}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*telh₂-}}. Cognate with {{cog|osx|tholian}}, {{cog|goh|dolēn}}, {{cog|non|þola}} ({{cog|sv|tåla}}), {{cog|got|𐌸𐌿𐌻𐌰𐌽}}; compare {{cog|la|tulī||I carried}}, {{m|la|tolerō||to tolerate}}, {{m|la|tollō||to lift up, bear}}, {{cog|grc|ἔτλην||to suffer, endure}}.

===Pronunciation===
